     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>I would appreciate any help you can provide in regard to the following issue.</div><div><br></div><div>I am attempting to fit a saturated path model that includes observed variables (no latent) - see below for full syntax. </div><div>Several DV&#39;s/endogenous variables are dichotomous. </div><div>I can fit the model when I do not declare the dichotomous DV&#39;s to be ordered. However, when I declare the dichotomous DV&#39;s as ordered, I obtain the following error message:</div><div><br></div><div><div>&quot;Error in tmp[cbind(REP$row[idx], REP$col[idx])] &lt;- lavpartable$free[idx] : </div><div>  NAs are not allowed in subscripted assignments&quot;</div></div><div><br></div><div>I also obtain this warning message, though, the error message seems to be more problematic:</div><div><br></div><div><div>&quot;In muthen1984(Data = X[[g]], ov.names = ov.names[[g]], ov.types = ov.types,  :</div><div>  lavaan WARNING: trouble constructing W matrix; used generalized inverse for A11 submatrix&quot;</div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>I have read previous posts in regard to the error message, and have: (1) renamed all variables, (2) updated my copy of R and LAVAAN to the newest versions,  (3) removed covariances between all DV&#39;s, (4) included the ordered declaration at the beginning of the syntax, rather than in the fit statement. None of these fixes solved the problem.  </div><div><br></div><div>Thank you,</div><div>Matt</div><div><br></div><div>SYNTAX</div><div><br></div><div><div>p.1&lt;-<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>&#39;<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span></div><div>HBA1C<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>~<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>EduLevel<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>AnnualInc<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Retired<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Student<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Work<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>private<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>public<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></div><div>GenHealth<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>~<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>EduLevel<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>AnnualInc<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Retired<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Student<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Work<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>private<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>public<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></div><div>StressDiab<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>~<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>EduLevel<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>AnnualInc<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Retired<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Student<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Work<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>private<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>public<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></div><div>DKA<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>~<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>EduLevel<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>AnnualInc<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>+<span st